window.products.push({"id":224073,"name":"Full/Double 2 Inch Soft Sleeper 5.5 Visco Elastic Memory Foam Mattress Topper USA Made","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/11TNIpcEWqL._AC_.jpg","description":"Soft Sleeper 5.5 has found a way to give you the same great sleep surface as a $5,000 visco-elastic foam mattress for a price starting at 94% less the cost of a traditional visco foam mattress that sell at some retailers for over $5,000! There is a revolution going on in bedrooms across the country. The revolution is not between the sheets...it's under them! Visco-Elastic memory foam uses a technology first developed by NASA to make the most comfort sleep surface ever. We have taken that technology and developed a luxurious Soft Sleeper 5.5 next generation material. You may have seen the visco-foam mattress story on TV but the secret is that only the top 2-4 inches of their $5,000 mattress is actually the technologically advanced visco-elastic memory foam. The Soft Sleeper 5.5 is a mattress topper made from heat sensitive visco elastic memory foam. This luxurious material reacts to your body temperature, so the surface stays cool in the summer and warm in the winter. Over 9 out of 10 of our customers report that the contoured surface cradles their body and helps eliminate those pressure points created by traditional mattress surfaces. Another 89% of our customers reported less back and neck pain too. When it comes to buying memory foam mattress toppers, there are many options that need to be considered. Many retailers will offer a variety of mattress densities and thicknesses. We however only offer the softest and most luxurious Soft Sleeper series in 2, 3 and 4 inch thicknesses. We are so sure that our Soft Sleeper 5.5 products will improve the one third of your life that is spent in bed that we will offer you a no questions asked in home trial for 30 nights. If you are not sleeping significantly better and waking refreshed, send the mattress topper back for a full refund of the purchase price.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/11TNIpcEWqL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Soft Sleeper Visco Elastic Memory Foam","source_asin":"B00C4DUT48","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-224073","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00C4DUT48","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00C4DUT48","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":224074,"name":"Rose Lake Grayish Blue Duvet Covers King Size Soft Lightweight Washed Duvet Cover 3 Pieces Bedding Sets with Button Closure, 1 Duvet Cover 104x90 inch","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":16.66,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81Kc70ouwqL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"SOFT AND LIGHTWEIGHT: This duvet set with ultra-soft little stretchy touch and the slightly wrinkled look gives a modern, comfortable, neutral, simplistic look, made of washed microfiber fabric, which keeps you cool no sweaty throughout the night QUALITY FABRIC: 100% premium microfiber with no shrinking or no fading, breathable. Easily add a classic touch to any bedroom’s look with plain design. Even if wash it frequently can’t affect its feels like soft cotton BUTTON CLOSURE: There are eight silky ties in where at every corner and the middle of each side, keep the comforter fixed in place. The button closure in the bottom open to the entire width of the edge, just like an oversized pillowcase. And the coconut button that approximately 1 inch across closer spaced reasonably apart adds a bit of rustic charm and interest to the cover USABILITY ALL YEAR ROUND: You can easily remove the heavy duvet or comforter in the hotter summer months and simply use the light and cool duvet cover as a blanket until getting cold season again. Use a slip/protective cover to your comforters, not thick extra add a layer of cozy warmth. A labor-saving device for you to wash cover only instead of the whole duvet MACHINE WASHABLE: Machine wash separately in cold water on the delicate cycle. Tumble dry on low heat. Make sure to take it out of the dryer immediately to reduce wrinkling! DO NOT BLEACH. DO NOT IRON","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81Kc70ouwqL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Rose Lake","source_asin":"B0995WXNRC","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-224074","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0995WXNRC","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0995WXNRC","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
