window.products.push({"id":224199,"name":"Healing (Lavender and Gardenia) - Atmosphere Natural Incense From Nitiraj","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61j8QGAGk+L._SL1064_.jpg","description":"A delightful combination of soothing lavender & gardenia.Hand rolled in India. Packet of 20 grams, which averages about 18 to 20 sticks. Each incense stick burns for about an hour and the fragrance will linger. Atmosphere incense brings you a selection of rare fragrances from the far corners of the globe. Each stick is made from the finest aromatic oils, natural resins, and herbs. These exotic ingredients are carefully blended together in an age old tradition. Embark on a journey of the sense, experience the rich enchanting aromas that will transport you to another place and time.  Atmosphere incense is hand-rolled in India, and is an all natural masala incense. By masala we mean the incense is made in a method which uses natural resins such as balsam and a complex combination of oils and herbs that are combined together to form a dough like mixture. This mixture is then rolled on to a bamboo stick then lightly coated with sandalwood powder. The result is a superior incense which burns very slowly and the after aroma can remain for days.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61j8QGAGk+L._SL1064_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Nitiraj Atmosphere","source_asin":"B002QLJ9C6","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-224199","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B002QLJ9C6","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B002QLJ9C6","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
