window.products.push({"id":224257,"name":"Natural Incense Sticks Variety Pack - (4 Scents, 48 Sticks) Charcoal-Free, Made from Upcycled Flowers | White Sage Incense, Frankincense Incense, Rose","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71MJdZGFpHL._AC_SL1280_.jpg","description":"BURN CLEAN CHARCOAL-FREE INCENSE : This incense sticks assortment pack consists of 4 natural variants- sandalwood incense, white sage incense sticks, rose incense, frankincense and myrrh incense. (Burn Time: Above 45 Min +) MADE FROM SACRED FLOWERS : Over 800 mil tonne of flower is offered to Gods in India every year, which is then directly disposed in rivers. We UPCYCLE these holy flowers to use in our incense sticks. WHY USE TOXIC CHEMICAL INCENSE? : Calmveda Incense uses only IFRA compliant fragrances to create a truly beneficial and relaxing experience for you. STRESS RELIEF & MEDITATION INCENSE - Sandalwood incense sticks has light sweet and woody aroma to calm your senses. While Rose incense sticks will make your forget your worries with its authentic love scent. SPIRITUAL & CLEANSING INCENSE - Our frankincense and myrrh incense sticks are used in catholic churches to create serene atmosphere. White Sage has leafy camphorous fragrance to purify your house. LOOKING FOR THOUGHTFUL GIFT ? : Each of us wants love, care & comfort for our loved ones. These handmade natural incense are perfect way to convey these feelings. HANDMADE BY INDIAN ARTISANS : Raw incense is sourced directly from rural women self help groups in India. This way we economically empower this community while providing you authentic products.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71MJdZGFpHL._AC_SL1280_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Calmveda","source_asin":"B09DYJ56RR","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-224257","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09DYJ56RR","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09DYJ56RR","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
