window.products.push({"id":224282,"name":"Hexun 5 Piece Stainless Steel Mixing Bowl Set with Colorful Lids, Non Slip Colorful Silicone Bottoms with Thickening and Volume Measurements Salad Bow","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61b+tBhkgUL._AC_SL1200_.jpg","description":"DETAIL DESCRIPTION  Mixing bowls comes with 5 set and 0.56mm thickness, including(Volume /External diameter/Product height) : - 1.5 Qt/7inch width/3.5inch height, - 2.0 Qt/7.9inch width/3.9inch height - 3.0 Qt/8.7inch width/4.3inch height - 4.0 Qt/9.5inch width/4.7inch height - 5.0 Qt/10.2inch width/5.1inch height  USING RANGE - Salad making, Vegetable/Fruit wash, Egg beating,Washing rice ,Knead dough  WORKMANSHIP  - Strong load bearing : Our stainless steel mixing bowls with strong load bearing and not easy to break - Deepen and Arc bottom design: Deepen design, no worry about spatter when you are doing egg beating and whisking.Arc bottom with smoothly,no dead corner when clean. - An integral forming process : integral process with polishing，No jointing and durable use，And easy to clean every corner of the bowl. - Curling desing: Easy to pick up or put down, no worry about hurting hand and no deformation. - Accurate measure volume :Ensure accurate measure volume of water or flour according to your actual needs. - Tight sealing： Food grade material bowl soft covers ensure air tight to the bowls. It keeps food fresh and make it easy to transport in a dinner party or potluck.  USE AND MAINTANCE  -USE :Our stainless steel mixing bowl set is dishwasher and freezer safe.  MAINTANCE -Don't use acetic acid and corrosive solvent clean -Don't use volatile solvent such as alchohol ,steel wire,hard brush etc to clear the stainless steel mixing bowls -Please clear clean after use and put it in the shade and dry. -Please take care of strike down, drop off,hit by hard objects and strong impact and cause the deformation. PACKAGE INCLUDING   5 x Hexun stainless steel mixing bowls with thickening colorful lids and silicone bottom  1 x Bamboo fiber wash cloth as free gift  1 x Gift box","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61b+tBhkgUL._AC_SL1200_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Hexun","source_asin":"B074VCVTHS","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-224282","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B074VCVTHS","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B074VCVTHS","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
