window.products.push({"id":224393,"name":"Max & Lily Low Bunk Bed, Twin-Over-Twin Bed Frame For Kids With Stairs, Grey","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":729.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/810FDO8ndNL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"The Max & Lily Twin Over Twin Low Bunk + Staircase is the perfect combination of fun and functional that both kids and parents love. The solid, knot-free wood bed frame adds strength and stability. Low Bunk + Staircase for kids uses a durable, low VOC finish that’s ideal for your clean and healthy home. Only 50 inches high, this space-saving low-profile bunk bed is great for smaller spaces and safe for younger children. The bottom bed sits only two inches off the floor, making it the perfect low bunk bed for little ones. Top bunk features tall 14-inch guardrails, so the bed safely fits standard mattress sizes. Low Bunk + Staircase with rounded edges offers comfortable, easy climbing. Added bonus – the Low Bunk + Staircase can be installed on either the left or right side of the bed to fit your room perfectly. The slatted headboards and footboards and flush, color-matched hardware give these kids bunk beds a clean, Low Bunk + Staircase look. Instructions, slat rolls, tools, and required hardware are included. With solid plywood slats and a metal under-bed support bar, each sleeping surface can support 400 lbs. of resting weight. This heavy-duty bunk bed meets or exceeds Federal safety standards for kids furniture. When it’s time for play, this low bunk beds' space-saving twin bed frame frees up plenty of floor space by stacking two sleeping surfaces. Add play curtains (purchase separately) to add even more fun to your kid’s bedroom. The Low Bunk + Staircase from Max & Lily offers exceptional quality and affordability that kids and their parents will enjoy for years to come. Max & Lily is a member of the Maxwood family of brands – the kids furniture experts bringing a tradition of superior quality, safety and fun!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/810FDO8ndNL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Max & Lily","source_asin":"B0B7JCXH5L","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-224393","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0B7JCXH5L","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0B7JCXH5L","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
