window.products.push({"id":224569,"name":"Swift Home Collection Ultra-Plush Reversible Micromink and Sherpa 3-Piece Down Alternative Comforter with Pillow Shams, Luxury Bedding Set,Camel, King","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81vhv9neolL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"SWIFT HOME DIFFERENCE: Snuggle in luxurious comfort during the cold weather with our Reversible Micromink and Sherpa Comforter. Fully reversible, the soft micromink gives one side a subtle velvety luster while the fluffy Sherpa, a synthetic pile fabric that resembles wool, provides plush and extra warmth. The baffle box stitching keeps the down-alternative filling from shifting during the wash. The comforter set comes with matching pillow shams for a cozy winter night’s rest. PRODUCT CONTENT: 100% micromink and sherpa polyester shell –The micromink provides a rich bodied texture on one side while the sherpa gives a warm, fluffy reverse. It is filled with down-alternative polyester fibers that will not trigger sensitivities. WHAT’S INCLUDED:King Set – One 102”x86” comforter and two king pillow shams 20”x36” with 1.76” flange EASY CARE: Machine wash separately on gentle cycle with cold water and like colors. Tumble dry on low and remove promptly or air dry. Do not use bleach. Lightly fluff after it is dry to reshape if needed. We recommend using a large capacity washer and dryer to avoid any damage to the comforter. This product is OEKO-TEX STANDARD 100 Certified – and industry standard showing the product has been tested to be free of harmful substances & chemicals.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81vhv9neolL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Swift Home","source_asin":"B07C9GM1RR","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-224569","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07C9GM1RR","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07C9GM1RR","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":224570,"name":"Hortense B. Hewitt Wedding Accessories Metal Scroll Cake Top, Letter P, 5-Inch Tall","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":14.78,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71RKaWOco7L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Hortense B. Hewitt is pleased to bring you an easy and elegant way to add personalization to any cake or table with lightweight, matte-finish, silver-tone metal initial cake tops. Each letter is handmade and stands 5-inch tall. At 1-inch deep, letters easily stand and some letters have bases for balance (you can easily cover the base with frosting). Hortense B. Hewitt offers an assortment of styles for today's bride and groom. Affordable and stylish, from contemporary to traditional, modern and whimsical - with Hortense B. Hewitt you're sure to find the perfect wedding accessory or gift.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71RKaWOco7L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Hortense B. Hewitt","source_asin":"B0194GWB4S","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-224570","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0194GWB4S","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0194GWB4S","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
