window.products.push({"id":224774,"name":"Granite Ware Better Browning Round Pie Pan, 9-inch","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81wxIZptm7L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Create the perfect apple pie! The dark enamel finish and solid steel core of this pie pan absorb, retain and distribute heat evenly, eliminating hot spots and allowing the pie to bake faster. Bakes crusts evenly so your apple, cherry or blueberry pies turn out spectacular. The nonstick surface releases food easily, requiring little or no added fat. Pan is 9 inch diameter, dishwasher and metal utensil safe. Recipe included on packaging. Made in USA.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81wxIZptm7L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Granite Ware","source_asin":"B004ZKSPM6","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-224774","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B004ZKSPM6","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B004ZKSPM6","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":224775,"name":"Luxury Designed Jewish Sabbath Set for Man-Silver Plated Kiddush Cup-Blue&White Talit(Prayer Shawl)-Stylish Star of David Kippah (Kippa/Yarmulke)-Kidd","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91-dVvnRODL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"The Sabbath ceremony marks the recognition and appreciation for the special holiness that separates the Sabbath from other days of the week. It is a time to welcome in the Shabbat with song and prayer - \"By the seventh day God had finished the work he had been doing; so on the seventh day he rested from all his work\". (Genesis 2:2) This special ceremony, involving blessing the wine performed at the beginning of the Sabbath. Normally Kiddush is recited by the father of the household while holding a cup of wine This is a moment which must fill us with wonder and joy. It must awaken our hearts to that spiritual contentment that is the secret of Shabbat's day of rest. The Shabbat Kiddush blessing ceremony, when experienced to the full, in the ways the Torah has shown us along with the deep insight that the Torah provides of the human soul, and the genius of the Jewish People, have combined to insure that the joy of Shabbat will overflow into and transform our material world. Shabbat, itself a great spiritual experience, is to be welcomed with wine and blessings and song and festive meals. Probably all who have participated in this Service would agree that one of its highlights is the prayer. Click the Button at the Top of this Page to get your own Sabbath Set Now!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91-dVvnRODL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Holyland Products Jerusalem, LLC.","source_asin":"B00L2C3GD8","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-224775","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00L2C3GD8","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00L2C3GD8","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
