window.products.push({"id":224790,"name":"Margaritaville Key West Frozen Concoction Maker with Auto or Manual Shave and Blend","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81OPvY5xZHL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Make a perfect pitcher of margaritas or other frozen drinks--with just the touch of a button. view larger Margaritaville Key West Frozen Concoction Maker -- DM1000 What'll it be--1, 2 or 3 drinks? That's the only decision you'll ever have to make with the Margaritaville Key West Frozen Concoction Maker. It does everything else for you, including shaving the ice and then automatically blending it with your favorite ingredients. Unlike other machines that crush ice, the Key West shaves ice to ensure smooth, delicious results. Feeling creative? Use the manual settings to put your personal touch on the consistency of the drinks. Then, let the Key West Frozen Concoction Maker work its magic, making your house party central. It's as easy as 1, 2, 3. Highlights: Concoct up to two, full 36-ounce pitchers of frozen drinks without refilling the extra-large ice reservoir Concoct up to two, full 36-ounce pitchers of frozen drinks without refilling the extra-large ice reservoir The machine knows just the right proportions of ice and ingredients using the automatic settings The machine knows just the right proportions of ice and ingredients using the automatic settings Make the exact number of drinks you want with the 1, 2, or 3 drink selector Make the exact number of drinks you want with the 1, 2, or 3 drink selector Customize drinks to personal tastes by relying on the manual settings Customize drinks to personal tastes by relying on the manual settings A dependable workhorse with its durable housing and sturdy glass blending jar A dependable workhorse with its durable housing and sturdy glass blending jar Beautiful just sitting there, trimmed in stainless steel Beautiful just sitting there, trimmed in stainless steel Keep your party flowing with restaurant-quality frozen drinks. Capture that casual island attitude. A Breeze to Use Fill the ice reservoir with ice, add measured ingredients into the blender jar, and you're well on your way to the perfect margarita or other favorite drink. Choose one, two, or three drinks from the control panel, then fire it up with the \"Shave 'n Blend\" toggle switch. Plus, for manual control, the handy \"blend only/shave only\" toggle switch lets you add more ice--or blend it as long as you want. Shaved Ice is Key The automatic \"Shave 'n Blend\" cycle uses a sharp shaving paddle to finely and evenly shave ice from the top of the machine, while blades in the blending jar pulverize all the ingredients to frosty smooth perfection. Glass Blending Jar The Key West Frozen Concoction Maker provides a sturdy glass blending jar with a 36-ounce capacity, measuring marks up the side, and an easy-grip handle. Both the blending jar and its lid are dishwasher-safe for quick cleanup. Automatic \"Shave 'n Blend\" cycle--or toggle between manual \"blend only\" or \"shave only\". view larger 36-ounce durable glass blending jar with measuring marks. view larger Accessories include a salt and lime tray and a travel bag for transport (sold separately). view larger What's in the Box? Margaritaville DM1000 Key West Frozen Concoction Maker, 36-ounce glass blending jar, Quick Start guide, user manual","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81OPvY5xZHL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Margaritaville","source_asin":"B000HWKSJY","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-224790","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B000HWKSJY","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B000HWKSJY","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":224791,"name":"Flortlias Transparent Leaf Window Sticker, Removable Static Cling Double-Sided Decal Clings for Glass Windows Door Decor, Watercolor String of Pearls","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":27.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71JA8XGtMpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Size: 15.75\"x47.24\"/40X120cm 1Pcs. Static Cling design does not contain glue. The transparent window sticker, good light transmission, viewable inside and out. Before use, just spray enough water on the glass surface. If the window sticker falls off, the glass has not sprayed enough water. This window film can be reused for several times if not be damaged, you can reposition and reuse it.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71JA8XGtMpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Flortlias","source_asin":"B0B6P737B7","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-224791","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0B6P737B7","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0B6P737B7","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":224792,"name":"Maytag MLI7000A Cordless Iron, Stainless Steel","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41Q39ZGDG3L._AC_.jpg","description":"Amazon.com Ironing can be tricky. There's usually a cord to work around, and the darn thing stays hot! Setting it down to answer the phone, for example, can mean leaving a dangerously hot appliance in a precarious position. The Maytag ML17500A cordless iron takes care of a lot of ironing-related hassles. First of all, it's cordless for freedom of movement. (There's a retractable cord in the base that is used only for recharging the iron.) The heatproof recharging stand provides a stable resting place for the iron; it's also a base for the convenient domed storage caddy (the iron can be put away while it's still hot!). It's a nice-looking appliance, too, not only the body of the iron--white, with off-white and gray accents and a stainless steel soleplate--but also the clean-lined dome of the white plastic storage and carrying caddy. A quick-release removable water reservoir with a 120-milliliter capacity makes for easy refilling. To adjust to the needs of various fabrics, the moisture controls allow for steam burst, steam spray, continuous steam, or a cool mist. And the heat dial has settings for linen/cotton, wool, silk, and synthetics. The scratch-resistant stainless soleplate is designed to glide smoothly over fabric for even ironing pressure with no bunching up. To clean the iron, wipe the housing with a soft, damp cloth; do not use scrub brushes, scouring pads, or any harsh, abrasive cleansers. Use a dry cloth on the charging pins in the back of the iron. To avoid scratching the steel soleplate, avoid running it over rough or abrasive surfaces such as zippers or metal clothes fasteners. The Maytag cordless iron measures 4-1/2 by 9-1/2 by 5-1/2 inches, or 6-1/4 by 11 by 9 inches when stored in its case. Maytag guarantees this iron with a one-year limited warranty. The iron comes with a detailed instruction booklet. --Garland Withers","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41Q39ZGDG3L._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Maytag","source_asin":"B0000BVG5V","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-224792","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0000BVG5V","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0000BVG5V","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":224793,"name":"Tree of Life Wall Plaque 11 5/8 Inches Decorative Celtic Garden Art Sculpture - Antique Silver Finish","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":29.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81ABYqNfhdL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Decorate your favorite wall with this beautifully detailed Tree of Life plaque from Old River Outdoors. Features a rustic antique silver finish. Made from hard / durable poly-resin material with amazing details. Metal hanger on back for easy, secure mounting. Measures approximately 11 5/8\" dia.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81ABYqNfhdL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Top Brass","source_asin":"B09J46M71X","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-224793","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09J46M71X","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09J46M71X","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":224794,"name":"Damanni Oval Cotton Handmade Crochet Lace Table Runner Doilies Dresser Scarf,15 Inch by 63 Inch，White","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":23.74,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71gYCBRFLIL._AC_SL1100_.jpg","description":"Damanni Crochet Cotton Table Runners Add a lovely lace accent to the rooms in your home with Damanni crochet cotton table runners. Crochet table runners are wonderful for adding a vintage touch to your home decoration. Invite your family and friends over for a relaxing brunch or dinner gathering.  Place Damanni table runner on your dining table for an elegant touch.  crochet table runners are great not only for doing your own home decoration, but also make ideal gifts for birthdays and house-warming. Traditional Handmade Our workers have 30 to 40 years of crochet experience, they have won medals in local crochet competitions.  Every item is hand-made by the workers.  Although it is hollow out design, the excellent quality ensure that it is very durable.  The stunning, decorative, and intricate crochet design, handmade knitted lace and flower shape design chic feeling clean simple but elegant.  Material - Made of 100% high quality cotton thread Washing and Maintenance Machine wash cold delicate, but hand washing is highly suggested.  Better after ironing.  Don't use bleach or soak in hot water.  It should be hung in ventilated place dry, avoid long time exposure in the sun.  There will be a small amount of shrinkage phenomenon after washing, which is the characteristic of pure cotton, is a normal situation.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71gYCBRFLIL._AC_SL1100_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Damanni","source_asin":"B07M9W571R","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-224794","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07M9W571R","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07M9W571R","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
